<title>UK: London gold fixes slightly firmer at $347.00.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes slightly firmer at $347.00.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $347.00 vs $346.40 previously. Still digesting German gold reserve revaluation implications. Generally viewed as long term bearish. Price seen weakening.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down a cent at $4.84/$4.86. Quiet.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $1.25 at $394.00/$395.00. Supported by dealer covering in tight market.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $0.50 at $173.00/$174.00.</p>
</text>
